$ we have\n\n$$\nu'(x)=\\frac{1}{x},\\quad v'(x)=3 e^{3 x}.\n$$\n\nNote that we used the chain rule to differentiate $v.$\n\nNow, applying the quotient rule and simplifying, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{\\prime} & =\\frac{u'(x)v(x)-u(x)v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2} \\\\ & =\\frac{(\\frac{1}{x})(e^{3 x})-(\\ln{\\left(x \\right)})(3 e^{3 x})}{(e^{3 x})^2} \\\\ & =- \\frac{\\left(3 x \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} - 1\\right) e^{- 3 x}}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487461 1080 "- 4 x \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} + 1" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487461 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487461 1083 #uuid "9ef752fe-c8e7-5714-85a9-0630780ed5c7" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487462 1080 "- x \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} + 1" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487462 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487462 1083 #uuid "9f3ff14c-bd71-5edd-9ce3-7a15e330b984" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487463 1080 "- 9 x \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} + 1" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487463 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487463 1083 #uuid "aa7eed3b-6e94-58ff-a735-b8d7429d5a80" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186487461 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487464 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487464 1077 "field-1" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487464 1078 #edb/ref 17592186487461 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487464 1079 #uuid "be083d33-9396-5f2d-8f6c-2365e427f22c" 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487465 1068 #edb/ref 17592186487464 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487465 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535257 17592186045443 true] [17592186487465 1071 "Find ${y}^{\\prime}$ for $y=\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{e^{4 x}}.$\n\n| ${y}^{\\prime}$ | 